fastrpc (1.0.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  The dsp_check executable in /usr/libexec/${DEB_HOST_MULTIARCH}/fastrpc/ has
  been renamed and moved to /usr/bin/fastrpc-healthcheck. Users of this binary
  are advised to consider this new path. A corresponding man page
  fastrpc-healthcheck(1) is now installed as well.

